{
 "about": "#113: Gióng on his mat at night (19:30; at 21:00 the family sleeps in the house): he lies and looks at the hero, and the line that he lies still shows while he lies.",
 "start": "?story=giong-mat&clock=1170",
 "lang": "vi",
 "allow": [
